You strike your target with your melee or ranged weapon, doing [160%, 176%, 189%, 200%, 210% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as nature and inflicting additional effects based on your active vile poisons:

Numbing Poison - Reduces global speed by [17%, 23%, 27%, 30%, 32% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.

Insidious Poison - Applies a standard poison that deals [168, 217, 254, 285, 311 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] nature damage over 5 turns.

Crippling Poison - Places [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] talents on cooldown for [1, 3, 4, 4, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

Leeching Poison - Heals you for [168, 217, 254, 284, 311 (TL1-5; CUN 100)].

Volatile Poison - Deals a further [101, 130, 152, 171, 187 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] nature damage to foes in a radius [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] ball.

Learning this talent in addition to the Throwing Knives talent allows you to learn the Venomous Throw talent, which can be used to throw poisoned daggers at your foes, but is put on cooldown when this talent is used.
